  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Perform fixity check on transfer of binaries if digests are provided by the client. This would occur during persistence, prior to writing to OCFL objects. A potential location would be here:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/6f3947c31f9d8b6a1643a95b58713a87bb98f1f6/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/NonRdfSourcePersister.java#L76"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/6f3947c31f9d8b6a1643a95b58713a87bb98f1f6/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/NonRdfSourcePersister.java#L76",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Since fedora supports multiple digests for the same file, the default DigestInputStream may not be sufficient (unless its possible to wrap the inputstream in multiple DigestInputStream)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
