  "description": "<p>Perform fixity check on transfer of binaries if digests are provided by the client. This would occur during persistence, prior to writing to OCFL objects. A potential location would be here:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/6f3947c31f9d8b6a1643a95b58713a87bb98f1f6/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/NonRdfSourcePersister.java#L76\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/6f3947c31f9d8b6a1643a95b58713a87bb98f1f6/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/NonRdfSourcePersister.java#L76</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Since fedora supports multiple digests for the same file, the default DigestInputStream may not be sufficient (unless its possible to wrap the inputstream in multiple DigestInputStream)</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
